  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfer of Persons in Need of International Protection to Belgium and Related Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to contribute to the provision of a durable solution to people in need of international protection in Lebanon, Tunisia, Egypt and Rwanda and other countries, by facilitating their resettlement to Belgium, from March 2024 to December 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
